{"availability":"available","full":"sioaeko/NLLB_translator","name":"NLLB_translator","description":"Multi-engine neural translator across 200 languages — local NLLB-200 / MADLAD / Ollama + free Gemini/Groq APIs. FastAPI + Next.js.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":16,"forks":5,"created":"2024-04-16T13:44:51Z","updated":"2026-10-02T17:07:39Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Asanari/nllb-translator","topics":["ai","ctranslate2","fastapi","gemini","gradio","groq","juypter-notebook","machine-translation","meta","nextjs","nllb","nllb200","ollama","python","translate","translation","translator"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Asanari/nllb-translator","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:13:38.725Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T17:13:38.725Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T17:13:38.725Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T17:13:38.725Z","stars":16,"forks":5}],"technologies":["Next.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A multi-engine translator across 200 languages — open models on your own server, or cloud models with your own key, all from one clean UI.","Pick the translation engine per request: NLLB-200, Tencent's Hy-MT2, TranslateGemma 4B, Qwen3.5 2B, and Qwen3 1.7B run inside the Space (no third-party API or key needed). TranslateGemma and the two small Qwen models use a bundled Ollama server. Cloud models — Gemini, Qwen and GPT-OSS on Groq, anything on OpenRouter, or OpenAI's low-cost GPT-6 Luna — work with your own key. A FastAPI backend with a small provider registry does the routing; a Next.js + Tailwind frontend puts it all on one surface.","This is a v2 rebuild of the original Gradio-based NLLB translator, re-architected into a multi-engine FastAPI + Next.js web app."],"features":["Multiple engines, one UI — switch engines mid-session; local and cloud side by side, grouped.","200 languages — the full FLORES-200 set, with a searchable picker and common languages pinned.","No third-party API for local engines — all five local engines translate on the server; cloud engines are labelled with where the text goes.","Built for typing — debounced auto-translate, auto-growing panes, one-click example phrases, skeleton loading, swap, copy, dark mode.","Keyboard and screen-reader friendly — arrow keys / Enter / Esc in every picker, labelled controls, live-region output, correct lang / dir on text."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sioaeko/NLLB_translator/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4df5cb5b91f02951142ac8c8f1e9dd120dc061c82435fdc5e604e9b7b9415955","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T17:13:38.968Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T17:13:38.968Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A multi-engine translator across 200 languages — open models on your own server, or cloud models with your own key, all from one clean UI.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sioaeko/NLLB_translator/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Built for typing — debounced auto-translate, auto-growing panes, one-click example phrases, skeleton loading, swap, copy, dark mode.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sioaeko/NLLB_translator/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"4df5cb5b91f02951142ac8c8f1e9dd120dc061c82435fdc5e604e9b7b9415955","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sioaeko/NLLB_translator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T17:13:38.969Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-02T17:07:39Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sioaeko/NLLB_translator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T17:13:38.970Z","hash":"4df5cb5b91f02951142ac8c8f1e9dd120dc061c82435fdc5e604e9b7b9415955","originalBytes":12660,"storedBytes":12660,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["ollama","groq","engine","model","api","engines","openrouter","space","backend","key","languages","models","one","free","hy-mt2","local","qwen","qwen3","translategemma","cloud","fastapi","keys","next.js","openai",